# ---- The Linux AppImage is ~114 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB plain-git limit.
# Attach it to a GitHub Release instead (recommended), or track it with Git LFS:
#   git lfs install && git lfs track "*.AppImage"
# then delete the line below so it is committed through LFS.
releases/*.AppImage

